    "description": "<p>[0.1.0] - 2025-01-01\nAdded</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Launch of the first version of drugsens, providing functionalities for drug sensitivity analysis in translational research.</li>\n<li>Support for .csv files.</li>\n<li>Comprehensive metadata extraction from microscopy images, including patient ID, tissue type, and treatment details.</li>\n<li>Automated workflow for image analysis</li>\n<li>Package in CRAN</li>\n<li>Zenodo</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changed</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated documentation to include detailed descriptions of metadata fields.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fixed</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Resolved issues with metadata extraction accuracy.</li>\n</ul>",
